<title>CHINA: China's Q1 coal output rises 6.9 pct vs year ago.</title>
<headline>China's Q1 coal output rises 6.9 pct vs year ago.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 309.8901 million tonnes of coal in the first three months of this year, up 6.9 percent from the same period last year, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Monday.</p>
<p>China produced 119.4363 million tonnes of coal in March alone, the report said without giving a comparative figure.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1961</p>
